OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785395897
OL,3,C'Why me?' Victim of crash caused by
OL,4,Cdrug driver describes life-changing
OL,5,Cimpact
OL,7,FA man who nearly died when a van
OL,8,Fdriver crashed into him while high on
OL,9,Fcocaine has spoken about the life-
OL,10,Fchanging injuries he's been left with.
OL,12,FJason Nicholas, 53, spent two and a
OL,13,Fhalf weeks in an induced coma after
OL,14,Fthe devastating head-on collision on
OL,15,Fthe A32 near Alton on 10 May 2024.
OL,17,FAfter he was rushed to hospital by the
OL,18,Fair ambulance, doctors told Jason's
OL,19,Fpartner Selena that it was unlikely he
OL,20,Fwould survive the night.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
