FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785395897
OL,3,C'Why me?' Victim of crash caused by
OL,4,Cdrug driver describes life-changing
OL,5,Cimpact
OL,7,FJason had numerous severe injuries
OL,8,Fincluding broken arms, legs and
OL,9,Fvertebrae in his spine.
OL,11,FHe also suffered multiple strokes
OL,12,Fwhile in the induced coma, leaving him
OL,13,Fwith impaired cognitive function which
OL,14,Fwill affect him for the rest of his
OL,15,Flife.
OL,17,F"I'm so, so angry, because his actions
OL,18,Fhave changed my life forever," Jason
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785395897
OL,3,C'Why me?' Victim of crash caused by
OL,4,Cdrug driver describes life-changing
OL,5,Cimpact
OL,7,F"I used to go on motorbike rides with
OL,8,Fmy partner Selena and I miss being
OL,9,Fable to do that.
OL,11,F"I don't understand how or why. Why
OL,12,Fdid it have to be me?
OL,14,F"I'm so angry that he was a drug
OL,15,Fdriver. It makes no sense why someone
OL,16,Fwould do that. Now I have to live with
OL,17,Fwhat he's done.
OL,19,F"I hope my story stops another person
OL,20,Ffrom going through the same nightmare."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785395897
OL,3,C'Why me?' Victim of crash caused by
OL,4,Cdrug driver describes life-changing
OL,5,Cimpact
OL,7,FJason will need lifelong care because
OL,8,Fof his condition.
OL,10,FHe's unable to return to work as an
OL,11,Faircraft fitter and can no longer
OL,12,Fenjoy rides on his motorbike.
OL,14,FJason's partner Selena Brash said his
OL,15,Fwhole personality has changed after
OL,16,Fthe devastating crash.
OL,18,F"He can't remember very much short
OL,19,Fterm," she said.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785395897
OL,3,C'Why me?' Victim of crash caused by
OL,4,Cdrug driver describes life-changing
OL,5,Cimpact
OL,7,F"Reading and writing is very difficult
OL,8,Ffor, for Jason as well.
OL,10,F"His personality has changed.
OL,12,F"He doesn't smile very often, doesn't
OL,13,Flaugh very often, which he did a lot
OL,14,Fbefore. He was very sociable, used to
OL,15,Fgo out a lot with his friends.
OL,17,F"Now it's, it's too much for him."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
