PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785395897
OL,3,C'Why me?' Victim of crash caused by
OL,4,Cdrug driver describes life-changing
OL,5,Cimpact
OL,7,FThe drug driver of the van who caused
OL,8,Fthe collision, Ben Talbot, 34, of
OL,9,FSouthampton Road, Landford, Salisbury,
OL,10,Fwas sentenced to 32 months in prison
OL,11,Fat Winchester Crown Court on 31 March.
OL,13,FWhen he is released, he'll be banned
OL,14,Ffrom driving for a further 46 months.
OL,16,FChief Inspector Emma Hart, of the
OL,17,FRoads Policing Unit, said: "I would
OL,18,Furge everyone to watch this video and
OL,19,Flisten to Jason bravely tell his story.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785395897
OL,3,C'Why me?' Victim of crash caused by
OL,4,Cdrug driver describes life-changing
OL,5,Cimpact
OL,7,F"This is the end result of one person
OL,8,Fmaking a selfish decision to get
OL,9,Fbehind the wheel after taking drugs.
OL,11,F"It is life-changing.
OL,13,F"It is forever.
OL,15,F"Please don't ever drive under the
OL,16,Finfluence or you could ruin someone
OL,17,Felse's life."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
